  "answer": "No, you cannot claim for minor scratches on your suitcase. Corvina Airways does not cover minor damage from normal handling, such as scratches, scuffs, or small dents. Only damage that makes the bag unusable, such as damage to wheels, handles, or straps, is covered. If you believe the damage is more severe, you should report it within 7 days of receiving your bag and provide evidence of the damage.",
